  "content": "<center>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/398e12c2605ef9c77750a151c2c8420b528836e8.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"烈焰剑 Logo\"><br>\n\n## 让火焰附加附魔显示火焰特效\n<br>\n\n[![在我的网站上查看资源包！](https://img.shields.io/badge/View%20the%20pack%20on%20my%20website!-black?style=for-the-badge)](https://mr-expence.github.io/projects/flaming-swords)\n<br><br>\n<br><br>\n\n本资源包为附上火焰附加附魔的剑修改了纹理。\n\n在 1.21.4 及以下版本需要 CIT 模组支持，因为 1.21.5 已添加自定义物品纹理。\n\n铜剑与下界合金剑拥有不同的颜色。\n\n来自 tixul 的 Enchantment Outlines 模组的 3D 锤与弓。\n\n烈焰剑现在支持 tixul 的 [Enchantment Outlines](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints)\n\n你可以使用 [ResPackOpts](https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts) 来切换资源包的部分内容。\n\n如果没有动画效果，请尝试在视频设置中关闭“仅动画可见纹理”。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/4638a6a686ae36d813e716894a67f75c4fe3cc33.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"木剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/19b75264e439553404618bbc97e68deaec40f325.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"石剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/9723049a021e7f69d4528c20c0517f45fcec396b.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"铜剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/da44cda12b205dbe847a44989ff3948f73760b0f.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"铁剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/e4322b6e4ad484a51a2a10322796023659a0eb7b.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/71ae0be6700fc9ddefd7225348aa303df000dc1e.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"钻石剑\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/c18252a5b12dbc4e3ef32a03e85155bfd6187ee6.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"锤\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/48f59d31699764b0a5856932a33d0eb3547f8b64.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"弓\"><br><br>\n</center>",
